    "content": "# SUJET OFFICIEL BAC SM 2019 - ANGLAIS\n**Session Officielle 2019 | MEPU-A Guinée**\n\n---\n\nMEPU-A/SNESCO\n\n                                 BACCALAUREAT - SESSION 2019\n\n                                 Profils : Sciences Mathématiques / Sciences Expérimentales \n\n                                 Epreuve de : Anglais \n\n                                 Coefficient : 2 \n\n                                 Durée : 2 heures \n\n                                 Sujet \n\n                                      A/Write two examples for each of the following tenses (5pts) \n\n a)-Past continuous:\n\n1..................................................\n\n2..................................................\n\n b)-Present perfect:\n\n1..................................................\n\n2..................................................\n\n c)-Past perfect:\n\n1..................................................\n\n2..................................................\n\n d)-2ad Conditional:\n\n1..................................................\n\n2..................................................\n\n e)-Near future:\n\n1..................................................\n\n2..................................................\n\n B/Write a tag question for each of the following statements (3pts)\n\n  1 - You are 26 years old. ...........................?\n\n  2- Amadou plays handball. ...........................?\n\n  3-Your family doesn't live in kindia. ...........................?\n\n  4-Aminata and Djodjo are not ugly. ...........................?\n\n  5-They have got 5000 GF. ...........................?\n\n  6-You are not good in English. ...........................?\n\n  C/Give one example for each expression.  Consecutive event in the past (CEP), an expression of certainty (EC), a conditional clause (CC); an expression of regret (ER), a Taq (T): an example of smile (ES); a relay of a message (RM); a warning (W); and a prediction (P): (3pts)\n\n Example : Fofana will leave Ghana next year. (P)\n\n1............................................................( )\n\n2............................................................( )\n\n3............................................................( )\n\n4............................................................( )\n\n5............................................................( )\n\n6............................................................( )\n\n7............................................................( )\n\n8............................................................( )\n\n9............................................................( )\n\n  D/Complete the sentences use a comparative (4pts)  \n\n1. Mariame's car isn't very big. She wants a...................car.\n\n2. This house isn't very modern. I prefer...........\n\n3. You're not very tall. Your brother is...................\n\n4.Bill doesn't work hard. I work...................\n\n5. My chair isn't very comfortable. Yours is.............\n\n6.This city isn't very beautiful. Paris is.............\n\n  E/ Write one paragraph about what you should have done and you shouldn't have done in your life. Use the back of the sheet to write your paragraph (4pts) \n\n                                    NB : Cette version est une version transcrite des extraits de l’originale. Elle peut\n                                    donc contenir des erreurs de frappe,\n                                    d’orthographe ou de données."
